# A bootcamper's feedback file, dropped here for triage by `/feedback-to-specs`.
# Transient by design: the skill archives it under `docs/feedback/` (Step 9), and the
# archive IS tracked — the negation below is what keeps it so. Ignoring the candidate
# stops a half-triaged copy from being committed at the root, where the next drop would
# overwrite it.
#
# SENZING_BOOTCAMP_PLUGIN_FEEDBACK.md is deliberately absent: that name belongs to the
# Senzing Bootcamp Claude plugin, the skill refuses it by name, and ignoring it here would
# hide a misdirected file instead of surfacing it.
/SENZING_BOOTCAMP_POWER_FEEDBACK.md
/docs/SENZING_BOOTCAMP_POWER_FEEDBACK.md
*_DUPLICATE.md
!/docs/feedback/**
